<https://newsroom.sgit.ai/world-news-day/type/Article> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One commissioned op-ed, as published on worldnewsday.org and frozen here. The prose is linked, never reproduced."@en .
<https://newsroom.sgit.ai/world-news-day/type/Author> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
