<https://newsroom.sgit.ai/world-news-day/type/Author> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A named person in an article's byline, in their professional capacity. Name and the role line they gave; nothing else, and never a contact detail."@en .
<https://newsroom.sgit.ai/world-news-day/type/Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://newsroom.sgit.ai/world-news-day/type/Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Organisation"@en .
