<https://newsroom.sgit.ai/world-news-day/type/Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An organisation an author's own role line names. Derived from that line, never typed by hand."@en .
<https://newsroom.sgit.ai/world-news-day/type/Theme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
