<https://newsroom.sgit.ai/world-news-day/type/CitedSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A page an article links out to. The evidence the piece offers its reader, counted as the piece offers it."@en .
<https://newsroom.sgit.ai/world-news-day/type/Licence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
